## Why local SEO matters for Maesteg businesses

In a town like Maesteg, most customers search on their phone before picking a business. Local SEO makes sure your business is found first — whether that's a "builder Maesteg" search or someone looking for a specific trade or service in the area.

## What's included in our local SEO service

